#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Learn how to be a better judge of men.
msgctxt "8784_松岡里緒奈：源氏名"
msgid "Hm, you think so? And you're a great judge of women, I take it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Respuesta de rama
#. y4:msg_section=12
#. y4:msg_section_label=Conversación 12
#. y4:msg_talk=12
