#. y4:msg_speaker=譚ｾ蟯｡驥檎ｷ貞･茨ｼ壽ｺ先ｰ丞錐
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
#. y4:msg_choice_index=3
#. y4:msg_branch_choice=Learn how to be a better judge of men.
msgctxt "8832_松岡里緒奈：源氏名"
msgid "Well, you're good at thinking up excuses, at least. I hate how men are constantly waffling."
msgstr ""

#. y4:msg_type=branch_dialogue
